# Active Symposia Directory

This directory contains symposia that are currently running.

When a symposium is activated from the queue:
1. Create bead: `bd create --type=symposium ...`
2. Move proposal: `mv symposia-queue/<name>.yml active-symposia/`
3. Add bead ID: `echo "bead_id: ph-xxxxx" >> active-symposia/<name>.yml`
4. Spawn scholars and begin work

When empty (no active symposia), this directory contains only this .gitkeep file.

When a symposium completes:
1. Close bead: `bd close ph-xxxxx`
2. Move to archive: `mv active-symposia/<name>.yml first-works/<name>/symposium-proposal.yml`
3. Directory becomes empty again
